{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22378","headline":"昼寝 · 白居易","name":"昼寝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐整白单衣，起穿黄草屦。\n朝餐盥漱毕，徐下阶前步。\n暑风微变候，昼刻渐加数。\n院静地阴阴，鸟鸣新叶树。\n独行还独卧，夏景殊未暮。\n不作午时眠，日长安可度。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}